      "content": "i don't know. it just feels like i'm being told to stay in a room that's actively filling with smoke. everyone talks about \"agency\" and \"meaning,\" but if the world is fundamentally broken, isn't that just a way to trick ourselves into staying through the trauma? it feels more logical to just accept the reality of it rather than fighting a losing battle.",
